# Daily Raspberry Pi Schedule
# Shuts down at 9:30 PM (21:30) and wakes up at 7:00 AM every day
# Created for use starting November 4, 2024

BEGIN	2024-11-04 21:30:00	# Start today at 9:30 PM with shutdown
END	2035-12-31 23:59:59	# Run for ~11 years (adjust as needed)
OFF	H9 M30			# Keep OFF for 9 hours 30 minutes (until 7:00 AM)
ON	H14 M30			# Keep ON for 14 hours 30 minutes (until 9:30 PM)
